{
  // Type-checks the client's test files, which tsconfig.json excludes.
  //
  // A COUNTED RATCHET, not full coverage. The client has 79 test files: 56
  // `.test.ts` and 23 `.test.js`. `include` lists the 42 that pass today (38
  // `.test.ts` + 4 `.test.js`); the other 37 are enumerated below with their
  // measured error counts. **Files are added to `include` as they are cleaned,
  // and the list only ever grows.** Do not remove an entry to make a change
  // pass.
  //
  // Relaxations vs the base config, each with the reason it is off:
  //   noUncheckedIndexedAccess  off  -- `calls[0][1]` on a mock the test just
  //                                     made is not a real nullability risk
  //   noUnusedLocals            off  -- fixture scaffolding is not dead code
  //   noUnusedParameters        off  -- stub signatures keep unused params
  // `strict` stays ON. Production code keeps all three flags.
  //
  // `exclude: []` is load-bearing: `extends` inherits the base `exclude`, so
  // without it tsconfig.json's `**/*.test.ts` and `**/*.test.js` exclusions win
  // over `include` below and this config would check nothing at all.
  //
  // The `.test.js` files are listed one by one rather than by glob for the same
  // reason the `.test.ts` ones are: only the clean ones are in scope, and the
  // list is the ratchet. They are checkable at all only because Task 2 turned on
  // `checkJs`, so leaving the rest out is a choice, not a limitation.
  //
  // DEFERRED, measured 2026-07-27 by adding each group to `include` and counting.
  //
  // (a) 18 `.test.ts` files, 505 errors, 366 of them TS7005/TS7034 implicit-any
  //     locals in service mocks. These build large hand-rolled doubles for
  //     LinkedInService, PuppeteerService and the messaging scraper; typing them
  //     is its own piece of work, not a by-product of this phase.
  //     74  src/domains/messaging/services/linkedinMessageScraperService.test.ts
  //     56  src/domains/linkedin/controllers/linkedinInteractionController.test.ts
  //     50  src/domains/profile/services/profileInitService.test.ts
  //     40  src/domains/linkedin/services/localProfileScraper.test.ts
  //     39  src/domains/navigation/services/linkedinNavigationService.test.ts
  //     37  src/domains/linkedin/services/linkedinInteractionService.test.ts
  //     33  src/domains/linkedin/utils/contactProcessor.test.ts
  //     29  src/domains/linkedin/services/linkedinProfileOps.test.ts
  //     23  src/domains/linkedin/services/linkedinConnectionOps.test.ts
  //     23  src/domains/profile/services/profileScraping.test.ts
  //     20  src/domains/linkedin/services/linkedinMessagingOps.test.ts
  //     18  src/domains/linkedin/services/linkedinPostOps.test.ts
  //     16  src/domains/linkedin/utils/linkCollector.test.ts
  //     15  src/lifecycle/appShutdown.test.ts
  //     10  src/domains/profile/services/profileIngestion.test.ts
  //      9  src/domains/automation/services/puppeteerService.test.ts
  //      7  src/domains/automation/utils/contentSignalAnalyzer.test.ts
  //      6  src/domains/automation/utils/responseTimingInterceptor.test.ts
  //
  // (b) 19 `.test.js` files, 778 errors, 588 of them the same TS7005/TS7034
  //     character. Converting or annotating these is a second piece of work
  //     again -- note that linkedinConnectionService.test.js is in this set, and
  //     it is the file that mocked an `upsertEdge` method the real service never
  //     had, which is exactly the defect class this config exists to catch.
  //    166  src/transport/wsClient.test.js
  //    135  src/domains/linkedin/services/linkedinService.test.js
  //    128  src/transport/commandRouter.test.js
  //    103  src/domains/automation/utils/interactionQueue.test.js
  //     56  src/domains/profile/controllers/profileInitController.test.js
  //     43  src/domains/search/controllers/searchController.test.js
  //     31  src/shared/services/controlPlaneService.test.js
  //     30  src/domains/connections/services/linkedinConnectionService.test.js
  //     21  src/shared/utils/jwtValidator.test.js
  //     12  src/shared/utils/jwtValidator.integration.test.js
  //     11  src/domains/profile/services/profileInitService.test.js
  //     11  src/shared/utils/crypto.test.js
  //      8  src/domains/search/utils/searchRequestValidator.test.js
  //      8  src/shared/utils/credentialValidator.test.js
  //      4  src/domains/search/utils/searchStateManager.test.js
  //      4  src/domains/session/services/browserSessionManager.test.js
  //      3  src/domains/profile/utils/profileInitMonitor.test.js
  //      3  src/domains/profile/utils/profileMarkdownGenerator.test.js
  //      1  src/domains/profile/utils/profileInitStateManager.test.js
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
